WEBVTT

01:45.010 --> 01:48.540
Good morning, I am the housemaid - Fubuki.

01:49.660 --> 01:53.830
Special Maid Agent Regulation Knowledge - Prologue.

01:54.240 --> 01:57.410
As a maid, you have to wake up earlier than your Master.

01:57.410 --> 01:59.530
Go to sleep after your Master.

01:59.530 --> 02:00.540
As well as serve them.

02:00.910 --> 02:02.040
Next...

02:02.040 --> 02:05.400
I have to get the clothes that were not dried yesterday...

02:05.400 --> 02:07.060
I've already done that.

02:08.560 --> 02:10.680
Towel, underwears and pajamas.

02:10.680 --> 02:13.120
Silk and 100% Polyester.{}

02:13.120 --> 02:16.480
I already figured out the difference between the materials when I was hanging them.

02:17.110 --> 02:19.550
 Of course, the time it takes for your bra to dry and go back to its regular shape

02:19.550 --> 02:23.250
and how much time does it takes for the marks it leaves on you body to dissapear.

02:23.250 --> 02:25.570
Maid guy has figured out everything about it.

02:27.710 --> 02:30.320
Who told you to find out these things?

02:31.290 --> 02:33.270
Anyhow, since when did you get in here?

02:33.270 --> 02:34.890
You idiot!

02:38.300 --> 02:41.950
The Clumsy Maid Girl who Doesn't Look Back

02:38.340 --> 02:41.950
Service Six

02:47.410 --> 02:52.640
The crabs are on sale, 1000 yen each and everyone can only get one!

02:52.660 --> 02:55.550
Yes! We bought some crab.

02:55.550 --> 02:58.510
I'm sorry for having you guys go shopping with me.

03:00.060 --> 03:01.520
Fubuki-san, did you catch cold?

03:01.520 --> 03:02.790
It's alright.

03:02.790 --> 03:04.750
I caught cold from showering this morning. {}

03:05.200 --> 03:07.160
What happened in the bathroom?

03:07.160 --> 03:08.610
I just lectured a beast.

03:11.810 --> 03:12.620
What?

03:13.840 --> 03:15.160
You noticed?

03:15.160 --> 03:17.090
We're walking around with a maid.

03:17.840 --> 03:20.730
This is a situation that all men desire.

03:20.730 --> 03:25.140
Also, our maid Fubuki-san is known as the beautiful goddess.

03:25.140 --> 03:26.500
Ah, you're embarassing me.

03:27.930 --> 03:32.140
I can feel it! Everyone's staring at me with their envious eyes. {}

03:32.140 --> 03:34.080
Yes, I'm shining now.

03:34.080 --> 03:37.130
I got in my hands the world's best action course.

03:37.900 --> 03:38.780
Shut up.

03:42.020 --> 03:43.730
We're going to cook crab tonight.

03:43.730 --> 03:46.830
Crab eggs, boiled crab, creamed crab, crab styled hot pot...

03:47.240 --> 03:48.860
Ah... I'm looking forward to it.

03:48.860 --> 03:50.230
Nee-chan, you'll turn fat.

03:50.350 --> 03:51.940
You don't have the right to tell me that.

03:52.040 --> 03:55.150
But... You ate my cake yesterday...

03:55.150 --> 03:58.330
I'm using up the calories in club activities, it'll be alright!

04:02.470 --> 04:04.470
I'm sorry, my guest.

04:09.240 --> 04:10.840
Um... my guest...

04:11.280 --> 04:13.280
It's overloaded, can you get out first?

04:14.730 --> 04:16.030
It's a lie!

04:19.900 --> 04:24.040
Starting today, the Fujiwara household will start an indefinite weight losing activity.

04:24.040 --> 04:25.360
Everyone will participate.

04:26.120 --> 04:27.540
Everyone?

04:27.540 --> 04:28.360
Indefinite?

04:29.140 --> 04:30.380
I don't want that!

04:30.380 --> 04:35.860
Just because when Nee-chan wants to lose weight, she gives in due to everyone eating around her...

04:37.080 --> 04:38.700
Do you have any problems?

04:39.960 --> 04:41.000
Not really...

04:41.300 --> 04:43.190
What about the crabs?

04:43.190 --> 04:45.630
Salad for dinner will be enough.

04:46.730 --> 04:50.630
As a maid you have to follow your Master's orders.

04:51.430 --> 04:55.200
I don't think there is a rule about maids losing weight...

04:56.400 --> 04:58.020
Kousuke-kun, go on.

05:03.430 --> 05:04.480
80 Kilograms.

05:04.640 --> 05:06.810
My judgment is that you're overweight.

05:07.470 --> 05:08.480
Next, Kogarashi-san.

05:09.910 --> 05:12.020
Crazy master...

05:12.020 --> 05:14.930
Getting Maid Guy to lose weight? You must be kidding.

05:15.220 --> 05:17.410
I'll show you my secret.

05:17.410 --> 05:19.920
Special Skill - Maid Guy Levitation.

05:30.950 --> 05:32.960
0... 0 Kilograms?

05:34.710 --> 05:39.390
Do you think weight matters to Maid Guy? Idiotic master...

05:40.010 --> 05:40.920
Finish.

05:41.050 --> 05:42.770
No cheating!

05:43.420 --> 05:46.020
Naeka-sama, am I next?

05:48.630 --> 05:50.020
35 Kilograms...

05:51.150 --> 05:52.880
Hey... Naeka-sama...

05:52.880 --> 05:55.410
Saying my weight in front of males.

05:55.830 --> 05:57.880
Amazing, as expected from Fubuki-san.

05:57.880 --> 05:59.460
The fairy of the maids! {}

06:01.080 --> 06:05.830
3...35 Kilograms... An unbelievable number.

06:06.870 --> 06:08.510
This sense of failure...

06:09.030 --> 06:10.380
Don't get tricked, Master.

06:10.790 --> 06:12.630
Look carefully under her foot.

06:14.320 --> 06:16.260
There's a small needle.

06:16.260 --> 06:18.480
Like this, the pointer cannot move!

06:19.540 --> 06:21.270
This is a trick to scam kids.

06:21.270 --> 06:22.270
Kogarashi-san!

06:22.440 --> 06:24.290
No cheating!

06:24.290 --> 06:25.600
Take that off, Kousuke.

06:28.660 --> 06:30.170
85 Kilo?!

06:30.170 --> 06:31.770
Yay!

06:32.310 --> 06:34.130
You're heavier than me... Fubuki-san?

06:34.130 --> 06:34.920
No!

06:34.920 --> 06:40.740
My weight combined with all these things that are hidden in the maid outfit are around 100 kilos...

06:40.740 --> 06:43.600
That means, you are saying that you weight negative 15 kilos?

06:44.360 --> 06:45.750
You cannot trick my eyes.

06:46.060 --> 06:51.460
Even if you subtract the weight of the equipment, you're still 2 kilograms heavier than a medium sized maid.

06:52.010 --> 06:55.110
According to Maid Guy's Scan, you're weight is...

06:56.020 --> 06:57.820
Idiot!

07:04.070 --> 07:06.070
Swiftness is a basis of a maid.

07:06.070 --> 07:07.750
Always keep control over yourself.{}

07:07.750 --> 07:09.820
You have to keep an appropriate BMI.

07:10.560 --> 07:14.570
To prove that idiot wrong, my goal is to lose three kilograms.

07:17.270 --> 07:19.880
Okay! Let's all do our best.

07:21.650 --> 07:24.710
Eating is a higher priority for me...

07:28.240 --> 07:31.290
This sauna isn't bad...

07:32.030 --> 07:33.930
I feel thinner now...

07:34.720 --> 07:36.920
We just started, Naeka-sama.

07:37.770 --> 07:39.940
Specially made metabolic stimulant!

07:40.570 --> 07:43.140
It was made for this effect, so it's very bitter.

07:44.850 --> 07:45.680
Bitter!

07:46.580 --> 07:49.890
If we eat one everyday, we'll lose weight three times as fast.

07:52.350 --> 07:55.410
So if I eat 100 tablets, I'll lose weight 300 times as fast!

07:58.250 --> 07:59.030
It's bitter...

07:59.820 --> 08:00.780
I think it's working...

08:03.150 --> 08:05.790
Look! Look! I'm sweating like mad!

08:07.020 --> 08:10.130
What are you doing? Are you stupid? Naeka-sama!

08:10.470 --> 08:13.970
My body and heart feel very light...

08:15.710 --> 08:18.780
Kogarashi-san, water... Get water and the first aid kit!

08:18.780 --> 08:19.820
No...

08:21.830 --> 08:24.430
That extreme splendor might be enough to make me lust for women.

08:29.130 --> 08:32.610
Only a bit... Risking my life didn't work.

08:33.370 --> 08:39.040
If we leave you alone, you'd soon be as light as if you were cremated...

08:39.570 --> 08:40.700
Where's Kousuke-sama?

08:41.060 --> 08:43.800
I think he's going to the sauna by himself.

08:48.690 --> 08:49.660
That felt good.

08:51.450 --> 08:53.330
I just feel a little dizzy from the heat.

08:56.980 --> 08:58.130
What's with you two?

08:59.150 --> 09:01.470
Don't give me that shocked look.

09:03.990 --> 09:06.020
My throat is dry.

09:20.000 --> 09:21.660
It seems like you're all suffering.

09:24.750 --> 09:26.830
"Sweating means lose more weight."

09:26.830 --> 09:29.590
The moment you think that, is the moment you became losing dogs.

09:29.590 --> 09:32.670
Since old times, you would have to claim your own victory.

09:33.280 --> 09:36.270
Look carefully, Maid Guy's Super Vibrating Claw.

09:38.600 --> 09:41.970
T-The apple became dry instantly.

09:43.730 --> 09:47.680
My power caused the water in the apple to evaporate.

09:48.270 --> 09:52.550
Like the useless sag of flab both of you are carrying on your chest.{}

09:52.550 --> 09:54.350
Think about it, there's even two of those.

09:55.530 --> 09:56.980
Sag of flab?{}

09:57.510 --> 10:02.480
Using my claw to compress and evaporate it, you will surely lose a few kilos instantly.

10:02.740 --> 10:05.280
It's up to you to chose how much to compress.

10:05.280 --> 10:07.040
Now, let me help you shrink it.

10:07.040 --> 10:08.820
Flabby Maid and flabby Master... {what?}

10:08.830 --> 10:10.080
Flabby Master?

10:10.210 --> 10:11.250
Flabby Maid?

10:18.690 --> 10:20.050
Fasting?

10:20.730 --> 10:22.740
Since it's like this, we have to use our final way.

10:22.740 --> 10:25.690
Starting from today, we'll start our indefinite fasting.

10:25.690 --> 10:28.390
No, Onee-chan... We'll become mummies...

10:29.260 --> 10:32.650
When facing great obstacles you've gotta bite the bullet, seal yourself away and overcome it.

10:33.230 --> 10:38.390
Even if we eat a bit, all our efforts will be for nothing.

10:38.920 --> 10:43.030
Anyhow, we always give up halfway and restart at zero!

10:43.030 --> 10:44.410
If we're going to do it, why not risk our lives?

10:45.200 --> 10:46.990
A demon... A diet demon!

10:47.820 --> 10:49.490
This should be your attitude, Nakea-sama.

10:50.110 --> 10:54.400
Until we achieve victory, I won't desire food... Even if I have to give up my life.

10:54.400 --> 10:56.300
I am happy to fast to lose weight.

10:56.300 --> 10:58.760
How can I let other people call me a flabby maid?

11:07.510 --> 11:09.960
Let go! Let go!

11:09.960 --> 11:11.130
No, no!

11:11.130 --> 11:14.300
How about locking us in the room upstairs?

11:14.330 --> 11:17.450
How about closing down this whole section?{}

11:17.450 --> 11:19.110
Save me!

11:20.320 --> 11:24.010
A Few Days Later

11:32.520 --> 11:35.180
Honestly, Masters that are always worrying me...

11:36.500 --> 11:40.300
You're losing consciousness, you cannot tell the difference between a dream and reality.

11:40.940 --> 11:44.840
Take this, special move - Daydreaming Maid Guy Illusion.

11:46.070 --> 11:49.800
Sending an image of only the bust being smaller after losing weight to Master.{rephrase}

11:53.830 --> 11:56.480
Yes! I've successfully lost weight!

11:57.930 --> 11:58.480
Huh?

12:01.970 --> 12:03.710
Next is you, Flabby maid.

12:04.150 --> 12:06.060
An ugly but happy flat chest.

12:06.060 --> 12:08.190
Your breast shall be compressed.

12:08.980 --> 12:13.510
No matter what, you have to protect them both. Flat maid.

12:13.890 --> 12:14.510
Eh?

12:17.350 --> 12:19.960
No!

12:20.470 --> 12:24.440
Next is an image of only one getting compressed.

12:24.670 --> 12:27.880
Turning into a male due to failure in weight lost should be interesting.

12:28.470 --> 12:31.390
The moment you chose to stay at home, is the moment you chose to trap yourself.

12:33.330 --> 12:35.560
Just suffer in your nightmare.

12:35.770 --> 12:38.110
It's smaller... It's smaller...

12:37.890 --> 12:39.870
There's something growing under the underwear...

12:40.000 --> 12:42.280
Save us!

12:49.860 --> 12:52.370
Are you awake? You bunch of morons.

12:53.800 --> 12:55.370
K-Kogarashi-san!

12:56.070 --> 12:58.750
Losing too much weight only does harm.

12:58.750 --> 13:00.370
It's time to give up and eat.

13:01.710 --> 13:02.830
Yes...

13:05.120 --> 13:06.100
Fubuki-san?

13:09.490 --> 13:10.540
Fubuki-san?!

13:10.540 --> 13:11.450
Fubuki-san!

13:29.690 --> 13:30.980
What an insane fever.

13:31.320 --> 13:34.580
Oh yeah, she seemed like she had a cold when we were shopping.

13:35.160 --> 13:38.850
What should we do? It's all because I got her to lose weight with me...

13:40.590 --> 13:42.050
This won't work!

13:42.650 --> 13:43.440
Nee-chan?

13:43.440 --> 13:45.250
It can't be... that you're going to take care of her?

13:50.500 --> 13:53.670
Health comes first, you have to smile energetically.

13:53.670 --> 13:56.160
Support your master from behind.

13:56.160 --> 13:58.350
No one will remember you after you die.

13:59.290 --> 14:00.580
I'm sorry.

14:00.580 --> 14:05.600
Leaving master alone due to being sick, it's a humiliation as a maid.

14:06.200 --> 14:07.600
Don't worry.

14:07.880 --> 14:12.780
An energetic maid lying down sick, it's a common situation in an eroge.

14:17.510 --> 14:20.210
A maid without a maid outfit is just a normal person.

14:21.780 --> 14:24.890
Who would've guessed that you'd end up in this unsightly condition.

14:25.240 --> 14:26.170
Shut your mouth!

14:26.740 --> 14:30.620
But you shouldn't worry, there's always Maid Guy when you're in trouble.

14:30.620 --> 14:32.970
I am a man that can be relied on no matter what or when.

14:32.970 --> 14:34.770
With an instant effect that heal sickness,

14:34.770 --> 14:37.640
... Maid Guy Healing Dance!{check the phrase before}

14:37.940 --> 14:40.370
You should dance too.

14:40.370 --> 14:42.060
I say no from my heart.

14:42.870 --> 14:47.240
No matter if it's medicine or poison, I'm the professional when it comes to healing.

14:47.240 --> 14:48.690
Such a small cold, I can...

14:49.900 --> 14:50.860
Not here...

14:51.020 --> 14:51.690
Not here!

14:52.240 --> 14:54.440
The material required for the cold medicine is not here!

14:55.860 --> 14:59.510
If only you had an invincible steel body like me.

14:59.510 --> 15:01.700
You wouldn't need to be afraid of any illness.

15:02.420 --> 15:07.060
According to Maid Guy Scan, the reason for your illness is because your body is too weak.

15:07.410 --> 15:10.510
You shouldn't wear wool panties, it's a crime against your own body... {what?}

15:14.810 --> 15:19.190
As a maid or as a guard, I cannot just lie down like this. {}

15:19.190 --> 15:20.740
I have something to request.

15:20.990 --> 15:23.390
The material required, the illusional moss.

15:23.390 --> 15:25.740
It grows up high in the hills, the Taizan Fukun.

15:25.740 --> 15:28.530
You can find it on Mt Fuji which is 3000 meters above sea level.{}

15:28.840 --> 15:30.550
Please go get some for me.

15:36.780 --> 15:37.880
Fubuki-san!

15:41.760 --> 15:43.540
Naeka-sama, that outfit is..?

15:45.070 --> 15:46.670
I'll just be borrowing it.

15:46.880 --> 15:49.210
I forced you to lose weight with me, I am partially responsible.

15:49.720 --> 15:52.080
That's why I have to take care of Fubuki-san.

15:52.480 --> 15:53.490
Naeka-sama...

15:54.150 --> 15:56.820
You should always drink eggnog when you're having a cold.

16:00.440 --> 16:03.930
There weren't any eggs, so I used beer instead. {wtf?}

16:03.930 --> 16:06.840
I also added some sugar and salt, and then I mixed in a lot of special stuff.

16:06.840 --> 16:07.400
Drink up.

16:07.770 --> 16:09.510
Special? What do you mean...

16:10.100 --> 16:12.480
I really mind!

16:20.380 --> 16:23.460
Before I make the cold medicine, I should make the medicine for the stomach.

16:24.660 --> 16:26.280
I'm sorry, Fubuki-san.

16:26.280 --> 16:27.490
Nee-chan didn't mean any harm.

16:28.320 --> 16:30.120
Nee-chan wanted to become a nurse before.

16:31.320 --> 16:33.750
When we were kids, our mother was sick and lying in bed...

16:35.690 --> 16:36.720
Here, mom.

16:38.820 --> 16:39.720
Is it good?

16:42.050 --> 16:48.250
When I grow up, I want to become a nurse and take care of mom forever.

16:48.980 --> 16:51.690
The dream she had when she was five years old is still...

16:52.410 --> 16:56.430
Every time she sees someone sick, her dream drives her to take care of that person no matter what, right?

16:56.430 --> 16:59.370
But her nursing skills also stopped at five years old.

17:00.520 --> 17:02.660
Mom got sick easily.

17:02.660 --> 17:07.410
But since Nee-chan learned how to cook, she rarely got sick.

17:08.230 --> 17:09.440
So it really is like that.

17:09.440 --> 17:12.590
The human body adapts whenever they are in extreme danger.

17:13.920 --> 17:14.920
Huh?

17:17.260 --> 17:19.570
Fubuki-san, it's time to eat.

17:19.730 --> 17:21.520
Didn't we have some crab that was left over?

17:21.520 --> 17:23.370
It's a good balance of nutrition for your body.

17:23.370 --> 17:26.680
I also added some sticky beans, cinnamon and something special into it.

17:27.310 --> 17:30.610
Something special ... What actually is it?!

17:34.790 --> 17:35.820
Are you okay?

17:36.740 --> 17:38.400
I've lived for nineteen years,

17:38.730 --> 17:41.700
but I've never been in a situation like this.

17:42.720 --> 17:43.730
No good...

17:45.550 --> 17:46.910
If this continues...

17:50.830 --> 17:53.340
Vitamin C is good for healthy skin.

17:54.180 --> 17:55.130
Cured?

17:58.610 --> 18:01.260
Thanks to you, my fever has gone down and I feel a lot better.

18:02.570 --> 18:04.340
Now I can work again.

18:05.890 --> 18:06.600
Thank goodness!

18:08.860 --> 18:12.490
But you just got better, so don't do such heavy work.

18:12.860 --> 18:14.060
Y-Yes...

18:15.690 --> 18:17.840
Then, I'll go and clean the rooms.

18:22.620 --> 18:23.670
Nice fight!

18:23.670 --> 18:25.080
Nee-chan totally believed you.

18:25.650 --> 18:26.930
Here, ice.

18:27.340 --> 18:28.820
T-Thank you very much.

18:30.880 --> 18:32.130
It's evaporating!

18:35.830 --> 18:37.630
I'll go and buy dinner.

18:38.210 --> 18:40.350
Please be careful.

18:40.350 --> 18:41.640
I'm going.

18:46.770 --> 18:47.390
Fubuki-san!

18:48.040 --> 18:50.890
With this, my life is saved...

18:51.870 --> 18:54.130
Kogarashi-san, please hurry up.

18:57.980 --> 19:00.940
Japan's tallest mountain - Mt Fuji. {Reihou fuji?}

19:00.940 --> 19:02.950
But I am Japan's best...

19:02.950 --> 19:04.860
No, the world's best Maid Guy.

19:05.650 --> 19:07.830
This is the Illusional Taizan Fukun.

19:08.760 --> 19:12.690
It contradicts its name, it grows like normal moss.

19:16.010 --> 19:18.280
Everything regarding missions is a secret.

19:18.280 --> 19:20.710
No one will remember you after you die.

19:28.080 --> 19:29.930
It's alright, Naeka-sama.

19:30.500 --> 19:32.010
Here, Fubuki-san.

19:33.160 --> 19:35.490
Your Master's safety comes first, even if you have to sacrifice yourself.

19:35.490 --> 19:37.660
No one will remember you after you die.

19:37.660 --> 19:40.020
No one will remember you after you die!!

19:40.550 --> 19:42.790
Enough of that "no one will remember you if you die"!

19:42.790 --> 19:46.150
If the Master is the actual danger, what should a maid do?

19:46.880 --> 19:49.160
A-Are you alright, Fubuki-san?

19:50.070 --> 19:50.870
I'm back.

19:52.950 --> 19:54.550
What's with both of you?

19:54.550 --> 19:55.650
N-Nothing much...

19:55.650 --> 19:58.580
W-Welcome back, Naeka-sama.

19:58.580 --> 20:01.250
Where did you go?

20:01.550 --> 20:04.720
I went to the market to buy healthy food for Fubuki-san...

20:16.350 --> 20:19.230
Fubuki-san is amazing in many ways today.

20:19.230 --> 20:21.990
Rapid movement is using up my energy...

20:22.710 --> 20:24.240
I'm sorry, I dropped it.

20:24.840 --> 20:26.750
But the clams that I brought from the fish shop seem to be in oka...

20:34.570 --> 20:35.540
A-Are you alright, Fubuki-san?

20:45.670 --> 20:47.530
This is not good, Fubuki-san!

20:47.530 --> 20:48.770
Why are you walking when you have a fever?

20:49.960 --> 20:53.010
N-No! Save me!

20:53.010 --> 20:55.210
W-Wool panties...

20:56.920 --> 20:58.850
This is dinner, Fubuki-san.

20:58.850 --> 21:00.690
Shellfish are good for your body. {shell-type?}

21:00.690 --> 21:03.150
That's why I cooked shellfish udon with special things.

21:03.580 --> 21:06.950
Special... What actually is it?!

21:08.270 --> 21:10.040
Naeka-sama's mother.

21:10.320 --> 21:12.110
The mother that is gone.

21:12.630 --> 21:14.670
I admire how you never get sick in front of your daughter.

21:14.670 --> 21:21.200
I want to learn from you, to become a woman that will never lose to sickness.

21:21.210 --> 21:22.120
It's ugly.

21:23.150 --> 21:27.210
As a maid, you have to be modest, don't admire others.{}

21:29.100 --> 21:31.030
You went to Mt Fuji to get it?

21:32.670 --> 21:34.550
This really can be made into cold medicine...

21:35.110 --> 21:37.300
I nearly gave up on the future,

21:37.460 --> 21:41.540
but I'm glad the medicine got here in time before I lost all my dignity and virtue.

21:43.540 --> 21:45.650
So I cannot take care of sick people any more...

21:48.050 --> 21:49.260
Seriously...

21:49.260 --> 21:54.400
